{"id":"e71305ac139aeef7","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-godel-encoding-details.md","title":"Gödel Encoding Details","display":"df-godel-encoding-details — Gödel Encoding Details","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-godel-encoding-details","aliases":["92-df-godel-encoding-details"],"display":"df-godel-encoding-details — Gödel Encoding Details","depends_on":["[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-arithmetization-steps]]","[[92-df-expression]]","[[92-df-signature]]"],"source":"第 II 章 pp. 14–16、20–25（PDF 31–33、37–42）","source_status":"本地有效重编码，非原书逐字语法"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-godel-encoding-details"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-godel-encoding-details</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-godel-encoding-details — Gödel Encoding Details"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"573d6ccf155d773c\" href=\"?note=573d6ccf155d773c\" title=\"92-df-arithmetization-steps\">92-df-arithmetization-steps</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c56ec2b54fc34fc6\" href=\"?note=c56ec2b54fc34fc6\" title=\"92-df-expression\">92-df-expression</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 II 章 pp. 14–16、20–25（PDF 31–33、37–42）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地有效重编码，非原书逐字语法"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_G\">\\(\\Sigma_G\\)</span> (signature, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a_0,\\ldots,a_{k-1})\\in\\Sigma_G^k\">\\((a_0,\\ldots,a_{k-1})\\in\\Sigma_G^k\\)</span> (token sequence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c56ec2b54fc34fc6\" href=\"?note=c56ec2b54fc34fc6\" title=\"92-df-expression\">92-df-expression</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c:\\Sigma_G\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathbb N\">\\(c:\\Sigma_G\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathbb N\\)</span> (bijective symbol code)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SeqCode}\">\\(\\mathrm{SeqCode}\\)</span> (finite-sequence encoder, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"573d6ccf155d773c\" href=\"?note=573d6ccf155d773c\" title=\"92-df-arithmetization-steps\">92-df-arithmetization-steps</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> (Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SymCode}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{SymCode}_G\\)</span> (definition-target symbol-code map)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}encoding\\text{-}details} \\vdash \\mathrm{SymCode}_G\\coloneqq c,\\qquad\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall(a_0,\\ldots,a_{k-1})\\in\\Sigma_G^k\\;\n\\ulcorner\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{k-1}\\rangle\\urcorner\n=\\mathrm{SeqCode}(\\langle\\mathrm{SymCode}_G(a_0),\\ldots,\\mathrm{SymCode}_G(a_{k-1})\\rangle).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}encoding\\text{-}details} \\vdash \\mathrm{SymCode}_G\\coloneqq c,\\qquad\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall(a_0,\\ldots,a_{k-1})\\in\\Sigma_G^k\\;\n\\ulcorner\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{k-1}\\rangle\\urcorner\n=\\mathrm{SeqCode}(\\langle\\mathrm{SymCode}_G(a_0),\\ldots,\\mathrm{SymCode}_G(a_{k-1})\\rangle).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gödel编码细节</li>\n<li>符号：用质数幂编码</li>\n<li>序列：用质因子分解</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_0 = 2, p_1 = 3, p_2 = 5, \\ldots\">\\(p_0 = 2, p_1 = 3, p_2 = 5, \\ldots\\)</span></li>\n<li>对 token 串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E=\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{k-1}\\rangle\">\\(E=\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{k-1}\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner E\\urcorner=\\prod_{i&lt;k}p_i^{c(a_i)+1}\">\\(\\ulcorner E\\urcorner=\\prod_{i&lt;k}p_i^{c(a_i)+1}\\)</span></li>\n<li>复合公式先展开为其完整 token 串再编码；不能把整个子公式的 Gödel 数当作单个 token 的指数</li>\n<li>编码可逆（可恢复公式）</li>\n<li>Gödel原始编码方法</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>现有签名把可数变量当作原始 token，并以素数幂编码串。原书用十三个基本符号，变量本身是有限串，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\land,\\lor,\\exists\">\\(\\land,\\lor,\\exists\\)</span> 是缩写；具体编码用十三进制，数码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> 的书中编码为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"13^n\">\\(13^n\\)</span>。本库有效重编码可用于标准不完备性重构，但不能声称复现原书的编码表或绕开替换算术化的具体证明。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 II 章 pp. 14–16、20–25（PDF 31–33、37–42）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetization-steps","status":"resolved","id":"573d6ccf155d773c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetization-steps]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-expression","status":"resolved","id":"c56ec2b54fc34fc6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-expression]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma_G$ (signature, see [[92-df-signature]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-expression","status":"resolved","id":"c56ec2b54fc34fc6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$ and $(a_0,\\ldots,a_{k-1})\\in\\Sigma_G^k$ (token sequence, see [[92-df-expression]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetization-steps","status":"resolved","id":"573d6ccf155d773c","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SeqCode}$ (finite-sequence encoder, see [[92-df-arithmetization-steps]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner$ (Gödel numbering, see [[92-df-godel-numbering]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma_G","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"(a_0,\\ldots,a_{k-1})\\in\\Sigma_G^k","display":false},{"tex":"c:\\Sigma_G\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SeqCode}","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SymCode}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}encoding\\text{-}details} \\vdash \\mathrm{SymCode}_G\\coloneqq c,\\qquad\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall(a_0,\\ldots,a_{k-1})\\in\\Sigma_G^k\\;\n\\ulcorner\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{k-1}\\rangle\\urcorner\n=\\mathrm{SeqCode}(\\langle\\mathrm{SymCode}_G(a_0),\\ldots,\\mathrm{SymCode}_G(a_{k-1})\\rangle).","display":true},{"tex":"p_0 = 2, p_1 = 3, p_2 = 5, \\ldots","display":false},{"tex":"E=\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{k-1}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner E\\urcorner=\\prod_{i<k}p_i^{c(a_i)+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\land,\\lor,\\exists","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar n","display":false},{"tex":"13^n","display":false}],"bytes":2236,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-73","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-encoding-details]]"}],"outgoing":["2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","573d6ccf155d773c","c56ec2b54fc34fc6","d666a3e3ee6c8148"]}